G1785.b:
⟪ἐντολή⟫, -ῆς, ἡ
(< ἐντέλλω, q.v.), [in LXX chiefly for ⁨מִצְוָה⁩; in pl. freq. in Pss for ⁨פִּקּוּדִים⁩ ;]
⟪1.⟫ generally, ⟪a charge, injunction, order, command⟫: ⟦Luke 15:29|Lk 15:29⟧, ⟦John 10:18|Jo 10:18⟧ ⟦John 11:57|11:57⟧ ⟦John 12:49|12:49⟧, ⟦John 12:50|50⟧ ⟦John 14:31|14:31⟧, ⟦Acts 17:15|Ac 17:15⟧, ⟦Colossians 4:10|Col 4:10⟧; ἐ. σαρκίνη, ⟦Hebrews 7:16|He 7:16⟧, ⟦Hebrews 7:18|18⟧
⟪2.⟫ Esp. of religious precepts and commandments;
⟪(a)⟫ of God's commandments: in OT, ⟦Matthew 15:3|Mt 15:3⟧ ⟦Matthew 22:36|22:36⟧, ⟦Matthew 22:38|38⟧, ⟦Matthew 22:40|40⟧ ; ⟦Mark 10:5|Mk 10:5⟧, ⟦Mark 10:19|19⟧ ⟦Mark 12:28|12:28⟧, ⟦Mark 12:31|31⟧ ⟦Ephesians 2:15|Eph 2:15⟧, ⟦Hebrews 9:19|He 9:19⟧; esp. of the decalogue, ⟦Matthew 5:19|Mt 5:19⟧ ⟦Matthew 19:17|19:17⟧, ⟦Mark 10:19|Mk 10:19⟧, ⟦Luke 18:20|Lk 18:20⟧ ⟦Luke 23:56|23:56⟧, ⟦Romans 7:8|Ro 7:8-13⟧ ⟦Romans 13:9|13:9⟧, ⟦Ephesians 6:2|Eph 6:2⟧; of God's command­ments in general, ⟦Luke 1:6|Lk 1:6⟧, ⟦1 Corinthians 7:19|I Co 7:19⟧, ⟦1 John 2:3|I Jo 2:3-8⟧ ⟦1 John 3:22|3:22-24⟧ ⟦1 John 4:21|4:21⟧ ⟦1 John 5:2|5:2⟧, ⟦1 John 5:3|3⟧, ⟦Revelation 12:17|Re 12:17⟧ ⟦Revelation 14:12|14:12⟧; collectively, ἡ ἐ. (cf. τ. ἔργον τ. θεοῦ, ⟦John 6:29|Jo 6:29⟧), ⟦1 Timothy 6:14|I Ti 6:14⟧, ⟦2 Peter 2:21|II Pe 2:21⟧ ⟦2 Peter 3:2|3:2⟧;
⟪(b)⟫ of things commanded Christ by the Father: ⟦John 12:49|Jo 12:49⟧, ⟦John 12:50|50⟧ ⟦John 14:31|14:31⟧ ⟦John 15:10|15:10⟧;
⟪(c)⟫ of the precepts of Christ: ⟦John 13:34|Jo 13:34⟧ ⟦John 14:15|14:15⟧, ⟦John 14:21|21⟧ ⟦John 15:10|15:10⟧, ⟦John 15:12|12⟧, ⟦1 Corinthians 14:37|I Co 14:37⟧.
⟪3.⟫ Phrases: seq. ἵνα, ⟦John 13:34|Jo 13:34⟧ ⟦John 15:12|15:12⟧, ⟦1 John 3:23|I Jo 3:23⟧ ⟦1 John 4:21|4:21⟧, ⟦2 John 1:6|II Jo 6⟧; ἐντολὴν (ὰς) παραβαίνειν, ⟦Matthew 15:3|Mt 15:3⟧; ἀκυροῦν, ⟦Matthew 15:6|Mt 15:6⟧ Rec.; τηρεῖν, ⟦Matthew 19:17|Mt 19:17⟧, ⟦John 15:10|Jo 15:10⟧, al.; ποιεῖν, ⟦1 John 5:2|I Jo 5:2⟧; διδόναι, ⟦John 11:57|Jo 11:57⟧; λαμβάνειν, ⟦John 10:18|Jo 10:18⟧, ⟦2 John 1:4|II Jo 4⟧; ἔχειν, ⟦John 14:21|Jo 14:21⟧, ⟦Hebrews 7:5|He 7:5⟧; ἐ. καὶ δικαιώματα, ⟦Luke 1:6|Lk 1:6⟧; ἐντολαὶ ἀνθρώπων (of Jewish tradition), ⟦Titus 1:14|Tit 1:14⟧; ἐ. καινή, ⟦John 13:34|Jo 13:34⟧, ⟦1 John 2:7|I Jo 2:7⟧, ⟦2 John 1:5|II Jo 5⟧.†
